apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# Android's gen/ is committed — the manifest, the foreground service and the
# keystore plugin live there and carry real decisions. Its schemas do not:
# tauri-build rewrites them on every compile and they are host-specific, so a
# Linux machine leaves linux-schema.json behind and a Windows one leaves
# windows-schema.json. Tracking them means a diff on every machine that builds.
apps/android/src-tauri/gen/schemas/

